   *   <li>It considers {@link Double#POSITIVE_INFINITY}, {@link Double#NEGATIVE_INFINITY}, and
   *       {@link Double#NaN} to be equal to themselves (contrast with {@code usingTolerance(0.0)}
   *       which does not).
