   *   <li>It considers {@link Float#POSITIVE_INFINITY}, {@link Float#NEGATIVE_INFINITY}, and {@link
   *       Float#NaN} to be equal to themselves (contrast with {@code usingTolerance(0.0)} which
   *       does not).
