   *   <li>It considers {@link Float#POSITIVE_INFINITY}, {@link Float#NEGATIVE_INFINITY}, and {@link
   *       Float#NaN} to be equal to themselves.
   *   <li>It does <i>not</i> consider {@code -0.0} to be equal to {@code 0.0}.
